title: Authorizations › New Case › Referral › Ask the referrer
route: /authorizations/new/:draftId?ref=RF-2053
intro: Ask the referrer for what is missing. The same dialog opens from the checklist and from the full referral page. In the demo nothing leaves the app.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: nothing is sent. The referrer's answer is in the next diagram, 'The referrer replies'.
---
start s1 "Click 'Ask the referrer' on a row,\nor 'Ask the referrer for the 4 missing items'"
start s2 "Full page: click 'Request information',\n'Request information for all open findings',\nor Resolve › 'Request information'"

overlay o1 "'Request more information'\n'To Crisis line 988 follow-up, fax (614) 555-0100'\n'The message comes from the 4 open items. The referral moves to Awaiting info until they reply.'"
process p1 "Message is written from the open items\nOne numbered line each: signed copy, current order, credentials or cosigner, form parts, ICD-10 code, level of care, risk screening, phone number, insurance card\nA failed age check is never listed"
process p1b "No open items: 'The message comes from this referral'\nOne line: 'Anything you can add that supports the request'"
input i1 "Pick 'Send by': Fax, E-referral, Email or Phone call\nStarts at the referral's own channel; phone and portal start at Email"
decision d1 "Message edited by hand?"
process p2 "Message is rewritten for the new channel\n'Please reply by email and Reader will pick it up'"
process p3 "Message stays as typed"
input i2 "Edit the 'Message'"
decision d2 "Message empty?"
process p4 "'Send request' stays disabled"
click cCancel "Click 'Cancel' or 'Close', press Escape,\nor click outside the dialog"
endx e1 "Nothing is sent\nThe referral is unchanged"
click cSend "Click 'Send request'"

store st1 "Referral is Awaiting info\nWhen and how it was asked, and the message, are saved"
process p5 "Timeline gets 'You asked Crisis line 988 follow-up for more information by email'\nand a pending 'Reader will read the reply when it arrives'"
ext x1 "Referrer receives the request\n(demo: simulated, nothing is sent)"
toast t1 "'Request sent'\n'Crisis line 988 follow-up was asked for more information. RF-2053 is Awaiting info.'"
screen sc1 "Checklist after sending\nAsked rows read 'Waiting on the referrer. Asked by email, just now.'\nNo 'Ask' buttons, 'Mark OK' stays, button 'Demo: the referrer replies' appears\nAsked rows no longer block 'Accept referral and continue'"
goto g1 "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Referral › The referrer replies"

s1 --> o1
s2 --> o1
o1 --> p1 --> i1
o1 -.-> p1b -.-> i1
i1 --> d1
d1 -->|No| p2 --> i2
d1 -->|Yes| p3 --> i2
i2 --> d2
d2 -->|Yes| p4 --> cCancel
d2 -->|No| cSend
o1 --> cCancel --> e1
cSend --> st1 --> p5 --> x1 --> t1 --> sc1 --> g1
